# {{projectName}} - System Monitor (n8n)

This is a ready-to-use n8n template to monitor API/website uptime and alert via Discord or Slack.

## Getting Started
1. `cp .env.example .env` and adjust your database and basic auth passwords.
2. Start the setup: `docker-compose up -d --build`
3. Access n8n at `http://localhost:5678`.
4. Import `workflows/health-check.json` and the global error handler into n8n.
5. Replace the URL in the HTTP Node to the website you want to monitor.
6. Replace the Discord Webhook URL in the Discord node with your own server's webhook.